<title>UK: EIB sets 9.5 bln peseta five-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 9.5 bln peseta five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Banco Santander de Negocios and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    9.5 BLN PTA   COUPON     5.80 PCT  MATURITY    06.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.906   PAY DATE    06.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    MADRID    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
